  "name": "reject_edge_anchor_missing",
  "expect": "reject",
  "why": "EDGE_EVENTS words with no anchor_ns in a session that also carries absolutely-timestamped annotations. A word holds only the LOW 16 BITS of its microsecond timestamp, so the edges are placeable only inside a 65.536 ms window; mixed with annotation time they land a whole board uptime away \u2014 measured at 10 days (LT-P2.105), which is how the edge lanes held thousands of transitions and drew nothing.",
